// SLIPSHOT audio engine (task 5). Everything you hear is generated by this file with the Web Audio API: there are NO third-party audio files
// (see ASSET_LICENSES.md). Layout:
//   1. small synthesis helpers (tone / noise)         2. SFX recipes (one function per sound name)
//   3. pure music composer (seeded, testable headless) 4. instruments + Song (schedules a generated, endlessly varying track)
//   5. AudioEngine (settings, buses, unlock, play, music modes)
// The AudioContext is only created inside `unlock()` (browsers need a user gesture); every other method is a safe no-op before that.
// Recipes and Song only use the generic context API, so they also run in an OfflineAudioContext (used by the manager's checks).

export const AUDIO_KEY = `slipshot.audio.v1`;

